Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.55,0:00:03.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經報仇了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:05.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,包括你的份
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.41,0:00:08.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.39,0:00:11.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:17.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我並不打算做對指名的人出兵這種蠢事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:20.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所謂攻擊Logos並不是這個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:22.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:25.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要終結他們所創造的這個扭曲的戰爭體系
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:28.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,走到一起來談談
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.09,0:00:33.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定能從他們製造的戰爭世界
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.19,0:00:35.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一起脫離出來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:37.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,羅德 吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:40.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Blue Cosmos的老大 揪出來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:42.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種…這種蠢事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.61,0:00:44.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.21,0:00:47.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾這混帳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.37,0:00:51.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真不感興趣嗎 與Logos作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.61,0:00:53.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:57.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽完議長的話後 我很感動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:02.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長明知很困難卻毫不退縮 不言放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.51,0:01:07.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話 我也能和任何敵人戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:12.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有很多話想與你們說
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,0:01:14.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先來看看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:19.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才開始就注意到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:29.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的新機體
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.99,0:03:07.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny是火力 防禦力 機動性 可靠性
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.36,0:03:12.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都凌駕於Impulse之上的最強MS
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.05,0:03:19.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而Legend則搭載了量子界面改良
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:22.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,適於任何人操縱的新一代Dragoon系統
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.37,0:03:23.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,創意大膽的機體
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:28.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,兩者都是工廠費盡心力的得意之作
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:31.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如何 中意嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:32.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 非常喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.85,0:03:40.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny特別為你進行了調整
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.90,0:03:42.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 為我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.35,0:03:47.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,參考了Impulse的最新戰鬥數據
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.23,0:03:48.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:56.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你的操作習慣 特別是速度遠超於普通情況
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:04:00.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你的力量實在驚人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:02.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最近越來越強
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:04.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:09.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse可能會受限於機體的極限
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.63,0:04:13.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個就沒有問題了 我可以保證
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:15.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:19.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你的機體就是這架Legend
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.63,0:04:21.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如何呢 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:27.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Dragoon系統 我想你可以完全操縱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:33.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:39.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是為了今後與Logos作戰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:46.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長您說過 為了平息戰爭而要攻打Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.26,0:04:53.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 雖然為終結戰爭而戰是自相矛盾的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:55.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但別無他法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:58.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為他們不聽勸告
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:02.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼只有戰鬥一途
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:04.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但為什麼對他們…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:08.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼下令攻擊ArchAngel和Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:10.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:11.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:16.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那艘船或許確實無意中擾亂了戰局
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.22,0:05:19.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但他們的意志和我們相同
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:23.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望結束戰爭 已經受夠了這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:27.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對抗Destroy也是他們行動在先
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:33.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那為什麼 連個交涉的機會都不給就下那種命令
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.39,0:05:34.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:37.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那我也要問了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:41.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼他們為什麼沒有投靠我們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:47.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,既然想法一致 他們來我們這邊不就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:50.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我的聲音應該也傳達到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.03,0:05:54.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那他們為何不來 而擅自作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.95,0:05:57.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是沒有機會
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:02.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我聽說庫拉提斯艦長在戰前也曾勸降
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:03.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:10.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲也和我們並肩作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:14.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.38,0:06:16.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.40,0:06:21.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你想說的我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.64,0:06:26.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會變成這樣 為什麼世事不能如願
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:29.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,實在令人生氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.48,0:06:34.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但要說的話 這就是現今的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.73,0:06:41.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現今的世界 我們都不清楚真正的自我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:43.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不清楚自己的力量和角色
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是不時受人擺佈而活
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.89,0:06:48.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.00,0:06:49.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ArchAngel
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.58,0:06:54.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不  即使對於你的朋友基拉 大和也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:07:01.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 其實我認為他很不幸 令人同情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.07,0:07:02.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不幸?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:05.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,擁有那樣的資質和力量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:07.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他本來是一名戰士
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:13.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛MS作戰時的技術當代無人可以匹敵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:19.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而任何人 包括他自己也沒有察覺
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.99,0:07:22.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因沒有察覺而不培養 不進步
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:25.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,單純受時代所擺佈而活
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:33.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那等力量若能正確使用 不知能有多大的成就
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:39.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和拉克絲分離 不知他有何想法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.65,0:07:41.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是挾持奧布國家元首
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:45.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,碰到戰鬥就現身胡亂攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.64,0:07:49.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,做這種事到底有什麼意義
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:50.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是基拉他…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:54.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,曾說過過強的力量會招來爭端的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.63,0:07:56.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那被挾持的奧布公主
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.31,0:08:00.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為ZAFT最高責任人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:06.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我無法對那樣莫名強大的力量置之不理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:11.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才下令攻擊 這是不得已的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:15.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他真的很不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:18.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他若能更早認識自我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:22.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,像你們一樣認識到那種力量的用途
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.14,0:08:25.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而能盡情發揮的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.79,0:08:33.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他本身也不用迷惘痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:37.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那力量也能受到讚賞 幸福地生活下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.01,0:08:43.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幸福…是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.57,0:08:44.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:49.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人能認識自我 盡自己所能作出貢獻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.74,0:08:52.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,充實地生活就是最幸福的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:54.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.94,0:09:00.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這場戰爭結束後我就想創造出這樣的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:05.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都能幸福生活的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.22,0:09:08.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就再也不會有戰爭了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:11.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然還只是夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:14.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我一定會實現
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:20.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以為了那一天 希望你們現在好好努力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.93,0:09:21.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:32.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,R部門的裝甲部件移至第三船塢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:37.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,補給隊諾比斯提耶路班 耶拉班立即到第三艙門
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.52,0:09:41.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,機體熱紋登錄在第8至第14停機坪進行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.69,0:09:44.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵我識別設定在C機庫進行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.34,0:09:46.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,港口塔台通告
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:49.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,接近中的地球軍艦艇 波布別克72級
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.18,0:09:52.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是東亞共和國前來會合的友軍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:55.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,藍色狀態 解除警戒態勢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:09:57.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.45,0:09:59.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這可真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.55,0:10:03.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到這麼多聯合方的軍隊投靠過來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:07.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 不過總覺得…不太放心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:12.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 好像和敵人共處一室似的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.14,0:10:13.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確實
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:18.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 要是突然全部倒戈 直布羅陀也完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.17,0:10:22.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:25.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你別說蠢話了 阿瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:28.89,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(620,630)}{\fad(500,500)}地球聯合軍 最高司令部 Heaven's Base
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.01,0:10:29.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作戰之前大家本來就夠緊張的了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:32.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:34.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算現在攻擊Heaven's Base
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:37.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,解決了逃亡的Logos 問題是以後吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.13,0:10:42.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣真的就能摧毀Logos了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.98,0:10:49.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva所屬  雷 查 巴勒路前來報告
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:52.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.60,0:10:55.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,身體方面沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.02,0:10:56.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.32,0:11:02.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在羅德尼亞的實驗室似乎遭遇了痛苦的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.43,0:11:05.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我太疏忽了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:09.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是吉魯的錯 我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:15.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也沒想到自己會變成那樣 吃了一驚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.23,0:11:18.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喝點什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.27,0:11:22.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還想多聽你談些細節
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:24.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.87,0:11:42.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是嗎？ PLANT真的這麼想嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:44.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個狄蘭達爾議長
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:47.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 那個拉克絲 克萊茵呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:51.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在PLANT的那個拉克絲怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.45,0:11:57.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我從心底盼望著不再發生戰爭的和平世界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:12:01.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我們不想讓奧布受到襲擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.77,0:12:06.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼他們為什麼沒有投靠我們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.43,0:12:10.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不想攻擊 別逼我攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:12.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.08,0:12:22.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然在這裡 怎麼行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.37,0:12:27.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你剛才在機庫也沒給議長明確答覆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.47,0:12:30.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼做的話真的會被懷疑的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:35.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個叫真的已經一直待在新型機上了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:36.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也快…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.11,0:12:40.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,懷疑什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:41.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說你不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:44.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:50.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長在和那個叫雷的交談 然後…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.32,0:12:56.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 阿斯蘭還是不行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:13:02.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他對Freedem和ArchAngel的關心超出了預期
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.87,0:13:07.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他也只是個戰士
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:09.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒用的事想太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:13.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,浪費了本有的才能
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.02,0:13:16.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 大和的影響嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.91,0:13:22.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭與他相遇算是不幸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:24.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或許是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.33,0:13:28.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但他已經不在了 那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.58,0:13:30.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:35.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只要他還沒被殺 心裡就…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.27,0:13:38.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這還真麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.96,0:13:42.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,罪狀足夠 接下來交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.48,0:13:44.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:48.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧 所以糟糕了 不妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.96,0:13:52.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,得趕快向他們表示沒有這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.43,0:13:55.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去議長會對你…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.15,0:13:59.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是Minerva所屬特務隊阿斯蘭 薩拉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:00.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是保安部的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.35,0:14:03.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有事想談一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:07.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是議長 頭腦真好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.87,0:14:10.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.18,0:14:13.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉  請開門
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.87,0:14:19.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我的確無法成為對他言聽計從的戰鬥傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.01,0:14:26.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論他的話聽來多正確
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.94,0:14:40.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 垂死掙扎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.69,0:14:42.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,找
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:52.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.49,0:14:56.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.65,0:14:59.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.97,0:15:03.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長只允許他認可的角色存在
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.57,0:15:06.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對他有好處的拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.62,0:15:09.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有作為MS駕駛員的我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:14.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但就算你也無法一直這樣做下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:18.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話 你遲早也會被殺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.80,0:15:19.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以一起來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:26.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我是拉克絲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:27.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.38,0:15:28.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不對
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:31.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.48,0:15:33.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是拉克絲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.46,0:15:36.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當拉克絲就好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.91,0:15:37.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:40.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,演角色有什麼不好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.58,0:15:42.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只要…只要演好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.50,0:15:45.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣活下去有什麼不好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:52.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 阿斯蘭也…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.01,0:15:55.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧 不要緊的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:01.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:16.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,門口堵住了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:18.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就搜尋室內和周邊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:19.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.93,0:16:21.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,盡可能逮捕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.16,0:16:24.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,萬不得已也只能射殺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.67,0:16:31.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.05,0:16:36.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.19,0:16:40.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 只是想逃出去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:42.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託 別出聲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:47.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你被追捕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.06,0:16:49.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.59,0:16:51.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事你事後去問雷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:55.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保安部 想檢查室內
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.38,0:16:57.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開門
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:16:59.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我出去後就叫出聲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.84,0:17:01.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說是被用槍逼使
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:06.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:08.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 不在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:10.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:13.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傻瓜 沒用的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:14.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.01,0:17:29.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我說梅琳
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:31.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你這是什麼樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:37.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 可是淋浴的時候門敲個不停
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:42.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好了快穿衣服 太不像樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:45.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再說怎麼了 這是在吵什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.29,0:17:46.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.06,0:18:04.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多謝 可是為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.64,0:18:07.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:13.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多謝相救 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.97,0:18:22.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,機庫 稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:29.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,入侵基地主機 讓某處響起警報的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:36.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 港口嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:37.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,何時過去的?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.38,0:18:44.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我去開車 看見後就出來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.79,0:18:45.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:48.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 發生什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.77,0:18:50.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,塔利雅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.91,0:18:51.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.35,0:18:53.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,詳細情況雖然不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.11,0:18:57.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭突然擊倒我們的保安員逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:01.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然應該不會去Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:02.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,姑且告知一聲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:06.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,根據情況可能會借用雷和真
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:08.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,逃走…為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:11.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以說還不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:13.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一會再聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.76,0:19:24.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那警報是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.94,0:19:26.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚 似乎有間諜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.07,0:19:31.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為現在聯合軍混在一起搞不清楚 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.53,0:19:39.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,追兵幾乎都在港口 現在應該…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:41.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.51,0:19:43.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.53,0:19:51.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與其被殺不如離開
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.87,0:20:00.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然這次又要逃走嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:01.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:05.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會饒恕你 居然背叛吉魯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.75,0:20:09.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 雷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:10.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.83,0:20:43.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 但這樣下去你會…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.53,0:20:53.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 讓Destiny和Legend做出擊準備
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:20:55.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:20:59.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被逃犯搶了MS 外出追擊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.63,0:21:13.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但接下來怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:15.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,找ArchAngel
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.52,0:21:17.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但那艘船…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.24,0:21:19.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有沉沒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.98,0:21:20.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉肯定也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.49,0:21:38.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.53,0:21:40.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.33,0:21:42.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了 雷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.14,0:21:43.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.70,0:21:45.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.89,0:21:48.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 但為什麼又會有間諜什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.19,0:21:49.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別大意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.39,0:21:51.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,追的是阿斯蘭 薩拉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.12,0:22:02.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.97,0:22:05.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會 為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今でも氣付かないでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,この靜かな空に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつでも思い出すけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,もうどこにももどれない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そしてずっと心で醒めて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そっと氣付いて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつかきっとやさしさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見えてくるように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's stopping me? I get stuck again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never OK for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's got into me? I get lost again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.70,0:23:25.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,追擊的是阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.39,0:23:28.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是無法理解的事實
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.93,0:23:31.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼至今為止看到的是?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.71,0:23:33.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自以為了解的是?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.05,0:23:36.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,交錯的話語消失在惡夢的大海
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:40.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,時間無情地逼使真作出決斷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.99,0:23:44.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.51,0:23:46.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷鳴之闇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.47,0:23:50.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引導那份命運 Legend
